      "title": "Verify fixed-replica reconciliation",
      "eyebrow": "Understand",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "The orders Deployment requests 3 replicas throughout this exercise. Before removal, inspect its requested count and associated Pods. The controlled removal of orders-pod-a produces a temporary observed shortage. Continue inspection until the controller creates orders-pod-d and restores the target. Completion evidence combines replacement identity with the restored count; accepted deletion alone does not verify reconciliation.",
          "role": "example",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "aws_devops.operate_an_eks_deployment_using_supplied_cluster_access_setup"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "aws_devops.operate_an_eks_deployment_using_supplied_cluster_access_setup#tb4"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "aws_devops.operate_an_eks_deployment_using_supplied_cluster_access_setup#f1",
              "aws_devops.operate_an_eks_deployment_using_supplied_cluster_access_setup#f2",
              "aws_devops.operate_an_eks_deployment_using_supplied_cluster_access_setup#f3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "The requested count stays the target while the observed count temporarily falls. Deleting one test Pod does not change that target. ReplicaSet reconciliation restores requested Pods and template; this is not demand-based scaling or cluster control-plane administration.",
          "role": "misconception",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "aws_devops.operate_an_eks_deployment_using_supplied_cluster_access_setup"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "aws_devops.operate_an_eks_deployment_using_supplied_cluster_access_setup#tb5"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "aws_devops.operate_an_eks_deployment_using_supplied_cluster_access_setup#f1",
              "aws_devops.operate_an_eks_deployment_using_supplied_cluster_access_setup#f3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
