              "option_id": "o1",
              "text": "The removed Pod orders-pod-a is replaced by orders-pod-d; requested replicas remain 3 and observed replicas return to 3."
            },
            {
              "option_id": "o2",
              "text": "The deletion command reports that it was accepted; no later inspection is needed."
            },
            {
              "option_id": "o3",
              "text": "The observed count briefly falls, so the requested replica target must have changed."
